            "math.sin(variable.attack_time * 180) * 34.3775 - 5.7296 + (q.property('twilightforest:rampaging') ? math.cos(variable.limb_swing * 14.3239) * 28.6479 + 28.6479 : 0)",
            "(q.property('twilightforest:rampaging') || q.property('twilightforest:tired')) ? 0 : math.cos(query.life_time * 103.1324) * 2.8648 + 2.8648"
